# Conformed dimensions & the bus matrix

## One dimension, shared, same meaning

```
FACT_SALES ────┐
FACT_SHIPMENT ─┼── DIM_CUSTOMER (conformed)
FACT_PAYMENTS ─┘
```
- Every process rolls up by the **same** region, product_line
- Line metrics up side by side · **drill across** processes

## The bus matrix — the plan on one page

```
Process   Date Customer Product Warehouse Carrier
Sales      ✓     ✓        ✓
Shipment   ✓     ✓        ✓        ✓         ✓
Payments   ✓     ✓
```
- Rows = **processes** (facts) · columns = **dimensions**
- A shared **column** = a dimension you must **conform**

## Why it matters

- Conformed dims turn separate marts into **one warehouse**
